<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="93ee062a-acad-54ca-b0c6-56d6d621d09c" name="I Legion Dark Angels" revision="7" battleScribeVersion="2.03" gameSystemId="86405571-5289-597b-b308-a9a2d68c00b9" gameSystemRevision="4" library="false">
 <selectionEntries>
 <selectionEntry id="ef76ae37-3ada-58f6-a5d9-c5406f815e56" name="Grand Cruiser" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
 <constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="false" id="747eb2f7-9b18-5879-aed8-b1142b7573ab" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true" /></constraints><profiles>
 <profile id="6a7f7fac-1fcd-572b-ab48-3e8bfd92da21" name="Grand Cruiser" hidden="false" typeId="806f9ff1-fd51-5ddb-b005-ce73a5d09d65" typeName="Ship">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="BS" typeId="d130e705-611e-5a0a-bd7d-ea8e848fdb2e">3</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Prow" typeId="84a55377-edbc-5825-a2bf-70c6155018f2">13</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Side" typeId="5f595433-7397-5c4b-9d4a-8f35d83a2b29">12</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Stern" typeId="cd9ec76e-f959-5560-8845-9ab242f16e71">11</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="HP" typeId="ef713781-2034-5fb4-83d1-e49d1d683694">9</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="VS" typeId="84309751-688d-50ef-8940-d8d042261a56">6</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="25d0e01e-8e74-55b3-8a2a-17773c881625">8″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Turn" typeId="899e9c58-70ef-5da5-8495-5bf6a8b7f8f0">45°</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Crew" typeId="2f6312dd-493e-53c6-96e2-d901afca0e81">7</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="95fcdc19-a63e-5326-8528-56ca7644edc6" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="443ce848-71d3-404f-a6d0-950fde1804b0" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 3 · Starboard: 3 · Prow Ordnance: 3 · Dorsal: 3 · Defence: 6 · Hangar: 1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ab1e1147-a363-4986-9eeb-02126c0c251d" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9d83d127-efb5-4bbc-b785-f2b9b358c62c" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 7 · Port 3 · Starboard 3 · Prow Ordnance 3 · Dorsal 3 · Defence 6 · Hangars 1. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
 <rules><rule id="791f2d0b-e469-552d-bd61-f6d34b36f6b5" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Twin Lance Turret resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="210af9dd-8089-5ec6-b8c7-cd7ffaa9d007" name="Capital" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Capital Ship for every rule that names one, and fills a Capital slot.</description></rule><rule id="95fe20e3-0f0c-5707-99a6-6be64cd42ed9" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="8f51a5f1-79cb-5d5d-a037-ebc6b34e86ed" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="7a9b2d24-408c-5b4f-b83c-6d7c73233f73" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="10dffffb-3254-5a73-927b-03f90bab3701" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="dbee46e7-fbfd-5519-940e-0a35b5cc5d65" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="1c34a490-b024-5c25-a4e8-80462bc7d148" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="356b4f4b-c161-5ae4-9b0c-86f317dda527" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="4a13515d-bf32-57ea-84c1-089013740a4a" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="34e17e46-9873-53bb-a55f-fb087377e0e4" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="c713be06-3b66-5505-9b81-ed5f9463293e" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="37435d2f-53f4-5d13-94bc-4a16d155ff92" name="Capital" hidden="false" targetId="bd422ebf-10b3-5085-89cc-263568c40fe0" primary="true" />
 </categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
 <selectionEntryGroup name="Prow Mounts" id="a5a22cf4-8527-5b62-af61-9ebcb1859458" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="44269914-7d49-5621-b561-449376e6a7e0" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="8904c441-ec58-5ea3-911b-3875831970ef" name="Torpedo Tube" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="f8b37146-936f-59aa-ab52-335e651b2de9" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="7c057aef-371c-5201-883a-d63d9539868d" name="Torpedo Tube" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Prow</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">9</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">60″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">One torpedo per tube. Bypasses Void Shields; Armourbane within 6″; Reload (2)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="10.0" /></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="64d7cd9d-ce39-5802-8c6e-c16ca9282164" name="Power Spur" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="421ecd39-0e23-53ba-8ace-4fab60a2695a" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="fe5e8dac-8290-5def-a42e-800f444c6af6" name="Power Spur" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Prow</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">Prow AV</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">—</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">—</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">Ram weapon — resolved as part of a Ram, at Strength equal to this ship's Prow Armour Value. Devastating (3); Armourbane.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="50.0" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup name="Dorsal Mounts" id="d2283e88-95b0-5635-ac15-b4f01e04b7d9" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="f3c0f893-e7e9-5101-9484-7c69c6513ae3" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="d18af545-37f6-5e08-a90b-8790a268571c" name="Lance Turret" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="2deafe2c-a24b-5358-9fe3-e5eeb11d9371" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="7f957b59-b2d4-5691-a589-1f29009cac3c" name="Lance Turret" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Dorsal</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">10</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">46″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">Gets Hot; Reload (1); Devastating (2)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="10.0" /></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="00a67be5-13c1-5345-9318-88d9c180fbb7" name="Twin Lance Turret" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="d576243d-9c33-55b5-90c2-a21d55a3b3eb" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="9f4cc907-3b34-57ee-bbcc-fe06b8fe8884" name="Twin Lance Turret" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Dorsal</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">10</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">46″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">Twin-Linked; Gets Hot; Reload (2); Devastating (2)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="15.0" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup name="Port Mounts" id="2e615cc5-93c2-5684-98ba-d0d21afda35e" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="4.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="e9f8ecb5-2a28-57e5-aa17-432686926327" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="9377290a-96be-5a96-9ce5-0c64354a1538" name="Macrobattery (Port)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="4.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="ff1b92d5-e7e4-589a-b216-2a236d66a341" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="d6244be7-7a60-5dfa-8833-3f5ba15835c7" name="Macrobattery (Port)" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Port</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">8</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">30″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="10.0" /></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="e2e77b04-0dc9-5f49-95b9-80689c245f49" name="Heavy Macrobattery (Port)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="4.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="4e622d56-c0f0-5dd7-8370-5f4a4872933d" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="81831a8d-cb55-5f7c-9217-24fd67ad7e57" name="Heavy Macrobattery (Port)" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Port</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">9</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">30″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">—</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="15.0" /></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="4c961cd6-1090-500e-b042-1616dcb1fb75" name="Hangar Bay" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="c2a949f5-b61e-56b6-9320-0138ba089f7a" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="320a35fb-f5cf-5719-b7ad-dc65b2b65d8e" name="Hangar Bay" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Holds one aircraft squadron, bought separately. Occupies one broadside mount that could otherwise carry a weapon, and may not be mounted on the Prow or Dorsally.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="p