 <profile id="b81770fd-b96b-59c1-b6f9-ed4f9ffd4ae3" name="Gloriana Common Rules" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">A Primarch’s Flagship: never suffers the Crippled −1 BS penalty; must be the Flagship; one per battle; games of 2,000+ points. Gloriana Reactors: once per battle, when VS would reach 0 it remains at 1. Dorsal Twin Lance Turrets fire into all arcs and never Gets Hot. Heavy Macrobatteries use Reload (1). Armament fixed: no Section 11b refits.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="c31e5c02-3612-53f1-87d7-442b81694710" name="Secrets of the First" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">In each Command Phase choose one weapon system aboard; until end of turn it gains +1 Strength, +12″ Range, or Armourbane. Hangar Bays (4).</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="717c20c1-88d2-539e-a3c3-d93cce84fd3c" name="Boarding Forces Validation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Boarding forces are bought against the ship’s Crew. Terminator/Dreadnought class limits are enforced; remember a Contemptor occupies 2 Crew slots.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="4b262ba1-5335-55fe-a35f-f4f0d0d70c6c" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 4 | Starboard: 4 | Prow: 7 | Dorsal: 8 | All-round: 10 | Hangar Bays: 4. Mounts, not arbitrary refit counts, are the limiting factor for weapon configuration.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="86d182d9-3659-40ab-8fba-3ddfcc35992f" name="Commander Embarkation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Choose exactly one Fleet Commander. This character is embarked aboard this Flagship.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8f360cba-ece3-40eb-9b10-8c73e0849d4b" name="Retinue Eligibility" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">The Primarch Retinue slot may only be used when the Primarch is selected as this ship's Fleet Commander. Choose at most one named Character of the same Legion.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="67972345-f64c-4f36-b088-a6271e9f7607" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 10. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
